ry metadata hits consume top-5 slots with zero evidence credit and no replacement; mapped page reads are counted. Record search, reads, per-question search+all-reads, native content, native payload, common packed context, initialization/indexing/RSS/storage separately. Component boundaries differ; no whole-product speed ratio.","modes":["v030_lexical","candidate_lexical","candidate_Q2","claude_mem_supplied_source_fts","ai_memory_released_binary","billion_locked_search_kernel"],"projection":"Each native search runs once per question/repetition. Apply the six common whole-block budget/tokenizer projections offline to the first response, do not repeat search just for packing.","repeats":3,"top_k":5},"freeze_before_selection":["candidate and baseline exact commits/runtime hashes","new evaluator and reused helper hashes","verified model files","component locks and source blobs"],"interpretation":"This is a new selection from the same HotpotQA source, not a new domain. After its first scoring it becomes regression data. These are evidence retrieval measurements, not generated-answer accuracy or complete write/summarize/generate product costs.","native":{"base_calls":4608,"budget_chars":8000,"conditional_mode":"project_local_fts_statistics only if its old-data gate passed","gate":"All strict source/scope/budget invariants pass. The default performance candidate must retain complete lexical payload equality. If the optional statistics candidate is present, its complete and annotation rates cannot decline in any of six new budget/tokenizer cells or in primary 512-token groups of at least 10 questions, unsupported nonempty cannot increase, and every individual gain/loss is retained.","limit":5,"modes":["v030_lexical","candidate_lexical","candidate_Q2"],"repeats":1,"token_budgets":[512,1024,2048],"tokenizers":["cl100k_base","o200k_base"]},"semantic_compatibility":"Before freezing, use only old authored36 and Hotpot128 as a Q2 compatibility sentinel; preserve model/vector/index