back and project switches","exact/stem/Unicode/CJK, directory-only match exclusion, empty project and partial scopes","default complete payload/cache behavior unchanged"],"costs":"Record cold derived-index construction, warm calls, every rebuild and switch, CLI connection startup, RSS and temporary storage. Quality development times are not formal speed claims. No claim of zero-overlap semantic recall or generated-answer improvement.","development":{"budget_chars":8000,"cache_size":0,"calls":8082,"cohorts":["synthetic61","authored36","public1015","hotpot128"],"coverage":false,"gate":"Complete-evidence rate and annotation recall do not decline in any of the 12 cohort/budget cells. Unsupported nonempty responses do not increase. At 512 tokens, no decline in either metric in a primary diagnostic group with at least 10 questions. At least one aggregate evidence or complete-evidence value improves. Every per-question gain/loss and smaller group is retained; individual zero-loss is not assumed.","limit":5,"modes":["global_default","project_local_fts_statistics"],"order":"Sequential fresh cohort/mode workers; alternate mode order by cohort index, random.Random(31061) question order at each budget.","primary_groups":["low_lexical_overlap_le_0.25","multiple_required_evidence","cross_session","cross_chapter"],"repeats":1,"semantic":false,"stop":"If the one candidate fails, retain the experiment and do not ship or tune it in this round. A passing candidate remains opt-in and must pass the independently selected cohort before acceptance.","token_budgets":[512,1024,2048],"tokenizers":["cl100k_base"],"use_cache":false},"name":"project_local_fts_statistics"},"registered_at_utc":"2026-11-12","release":"Only accepted improvements enter the next release. README shows the latest recommended configuration and verified comparisons with necessary limitations; detailed historic reports stay linked. Keep deployment simple and the workflow diagram compact. All earlier tags remain unchanged.